            "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:00:51.328737+00:00",
            "notes": "Since we have been sleeping as much as possible, we will have a lot of banked up health ready for us. Get [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) to prepare for the later rounds!\n\nTo make it a bit easier, purchasing [Quick Scope](item_c4ddab86-3ae0-4c5d-92ca-cead87dcec84) makes aiming feel more responsive as well as increase your damage. \n\nFinally, [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) improves your speed and survivability. You can even use this on the offensive! I have dove low health Reins to anti-nade them sleep and damage. If you do this right, you and your team can get an easy elim!\n\nIf you have enough cash, i'd suggest [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e). It is still important to heal your team and this item will allow you to up your heals per second.",
