            "notes": "I am going to suggest [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448). With the buff to Tranq, amping up the CD and WP with one item is great! Each use of  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) will trigger this item!\n\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if need more pressure on flying heroes. *Read the item note, I don't really like this item.\n\n-----\n\nAt this point, eliminating diving heroes has become easy! Sleep the diving hero with your enhanced Sleep Dart and make sure you take your time to line up the headshot. The combo I typically do is Sleep-Headshot-Nade-Bodyshot-Melee",
